---
/**
 * The still backdrop the Stage B 3D canvas will crossfade over. It is the same
 * workstation scene, merely still, so visitors without WebGL, on weak devices,
 * or under reduced motion see the desk rather than an empty page. Explicit
 * width/height reserve its aspect ratio so the canvas arriving later cannot
 * shift layout. Decorative: alt is empty and it is never lazy-loaded, because
 * it is the first paint of the page.
 */
---

<img
  data-desk-poster
  src="/desk-poster.webp"
  width="1600"
  height="900"
  fetchpriority="high"
  alt=""
/>

<style>
  img[data-desk-poster] {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
</style>
